  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADC PF Preparatory Nature 2014 - SADC PF Preparatory Nature</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SADC PF Preparatory Nature 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

SADC PF har ans&#xf6;kt om 1 832 000 SEK i st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r sin insats &quot;F&#xf6;reberedande fas: Sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa, r&#xe4;ttigheter &amp; HIV/AIDS &amp; Governance 2014-2017&#x201d; under perioden 19 maj 2014 &#x2013; 30 oktober 2014. St&#xf6;det syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra SADC:s tekniska kompetens i framtagandet av ett starkt f&#xf6;rslag kring &quot;Sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa, r&#xe4;ttigheter &amp; HIV/AIDS &amp; Governance 2014-2017&#x201d; genom att: 
1.Genomf&#xf6;ra en intern kapacitetsbyggande workshop
2.Genomf&#xf6;ra en &#x201d;baseline&#x201d;-studie i 7 utvalda SADC l&#xe4;nder
3.Rekrytera tv&#xe5; handl&#xe4;ggare (M&amp;E och PR).

SADC PF kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra insatsen, med den totala budgeten 2 320 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADC PF has applied to Sida for funding of 2 320 000 million SEK to carry out the Inception Phase: SEXUAL &amp; REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH, RIGHTS &amp; HIV/AIDS &amp; GOVERNANCE  under  2014 - 2017  during the period May 19 2014- October 30 2014. 
The intervention aims to improve SADC PF&apos;s technical competence by means of  :
1. Conducting an internal capacity building workshop.
2. Conducting a baseline survey in 7 SADC selected countries. 
3, Recruiting 2 officers: M&amp;E and public relations.</narrative>
  </description>
